1
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:54,480
All clear at the hotel entrance.

2
00:01:56,159 --> 00:01:59,200
I don't sense any danger on my end.

3
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,560
The traffic and pedestrians nearby,

4
00:02:02,719 --> 00:02:04,840
and around the street corner—everything looks normal.

5
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,080
Wait.

6
00:02:33,479 --> 00:02:34,520
It's just a cat.

7
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:41,599
Shalan, cats scratch too.

8
00:02:41,719 --> 00:02:42,800
You need to be careful.

9
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:26,720
The competition in your industry is really fierce.

10
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,399
Competition is inevitable.

11
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:30,560
We're just learning from each other.

12
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:33,360
Nobody's perfect, after all.

13
00:04:38,519 --> 00:04:39,319
How's it looking?

14
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:40,959
Did you actually see

15
00:04:40,959 --> 00:04:43,399
all of them hand over their guns?

16
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,920
I... I saw it with my own eyes.

17
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,079
They put all their weapons

18
00:04:46,079 --> 00:04:47,600
into a small box.

19
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,600
So I think this meeting should be

20
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:51,079
safe.

21
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:56,240
The company's only bulletproof vest...

22
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,120
You're the one wearing it.

23
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,000
How does it feel?

24
00:04:58,519 --> 00:04:59,319
I feel...

25
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:03,120
Look, let me explain something to you guys.

26
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,920
I'm different from you.

27
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:07,079
I'm the sole heir of four generations in the Yang family.

28
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,480
If anything happens to me,

29
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:10,199
the Yang family line ends with me.

30
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,519
So I'm really

31
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:13,199
not just thinking of myself.

32
00:05:13,199 --> 00:05:15,399
I'm thinking of my family's legacy.

33
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:19,319
Oh, give me a break. What,

34
00:05:19,759 --> 00:05:21,399
does your family have a throne to inherit?

35
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,199
You have a sacred mission,

36
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:24,600
so our lives are worthless?

37
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,279
You're already wearing the vest,

38
00:05:28,279 --> 00:05:29,800
so drop the high-and-mighty excuses,

39
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,560
will you?

40
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,360
What's going on?

41
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,759
The meeting can't be disturbed.

42
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:46,759
Well...

43
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,040
What do we do?

44
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,839
Shouldn't we go up and check?

45
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:53,319
Wh-What's wrong?

46
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:55,480
Did something happen?

47
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:56,879
I didn't hear anything.

48
00:06:00,639 --> 00:06:02,000
Aren't you wearing the vest?

49
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:02,920
Go up and take a look.

50
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:03,800
Me?

51
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,519
Yeah.

52
00:06:06,319 --> 00:06:07,680
I'm just a frail scholar.

53
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:08,920
What good will I do up there?

54
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,920
Then take off the vest!

55
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:14,279
Anda, aren't you great at fighting?

56
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:16,399
Why don't you go check it out?

57
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,319
Fine, I'll go.

58
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,399
Coward.

59
00:06:34,439 --> 00:06:36,600
Anda, leave him to me.

60
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,560
Should we take him to the hospital?

61
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,360
No need.

62
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:44,240
Help him back to his room.

63
00:06:44,399 --> 00:06:45,439
The doctor will be here shortly.

64
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,360
Are you sure he doesn't need a hospital?

65
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:56,560
No. They're just superficial injuries.

66
00:06:57,199 --> 00:06:58,439
Basic treatment will be enough.

67
00:07:02,399 --> 00:07:03,519
How much longer will this meeting last?

68
00:07:03,519 --> 00:07:04,319
I don't know.

69
00:07:04,959 --> 00:07:06,399
Could something like this happen again?

70
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,240
Hard to predict.

71
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:18,279
Let go of me! Let go!

72
00:07:18,959 --> 00:07:19,800
Let me go!

73
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,639
Let me go! You can't do this!

74
00:07:24,839 --> 00:07:25,639
Let go of me!

75
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:33,800
Mr. Xiao, if this meeting keeps dragging on,

76
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,600
the hotel staff are going to go on strike!

77
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:37,800
I know.

78
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:40,040
I mean, look at this mess!

79
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:40,879
Three chefs,

80
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,279
three cleaners,

81
00:07:42,439 --> 00:07:43,639
and five servers—

82
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,879
they all asked for time off!

83
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,519
What do we do? Think of something!

84
00:07:47,639 --> 00:07:48,959
We can't keep going like this.

85
00:07:50,079 --> 00:07:51,160
I'm trying to!

86
00:07:51,839 --> 00:07:53,319
Go help out in the restaurant right away.

87
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:56,199
I still have to go help clean guest rooms.

88
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,600
When are they finally leaving?

89
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,360
Wait.

90
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,159
If this commotion keeps up,

91
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:41,519
the hotel's going to go under.

92
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:14,080
What are you doing?

93
00:09:15,399 --> 00:09:16,200
What's wrong?

94
00:09:16,639 --> 00:09:17,440
Come on, let's go.

95
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:21,639
Let's go.

96
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,960
Why is she covered with a man's jacket?

97
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,559
Hey, I'm asking you.

98
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,320
Wilson plans to retire.

99
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,559
But this meeting

100
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:35,919
hasn't gone smoothly.

101
00:09:38,279 --> 00:09:40,840
Do you know who the successor is?

102
00:09:42,679 --> 00:09:44,799
Everyone at the meeting has a shot.

103
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:50,080
Wilson relied on real strength,

104
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,000
not guns

105
00:09:52,919 --> 00:09:55,600
and money, to get where he is today.

106
00:09:59,159 --> 00:10:00,960
Everyone likes taking advantage of others,

107
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,559
but hates being taken advantage of.

108
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:07,600
It's hard to make everyone happy.

109
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,720
The meeting isn't even over,

110
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,480
and someone's already getting impatient.

111
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:14,759
Wei Tian.

112
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:18,200
Wilson is in your hands.

113
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,080
What about your own safety?

114
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,759
I've been an orphan since childhood.

115
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,600
If not for Wilson,

116
00:10:26,159 --> 00:10:27,440
I wouldn't be who I am today.

117
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:29,960
As you Chinese say,

118
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:33,679
"Repay a drop of kindness with a gushing spring."

119
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,039
Understood.

120
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,200
Then I won't drink any more.

121
00:10:48,039 --> 00:10:48,840
Hello.

122
00:11:03,799 --> 00:11:05,000
All set, thanks.

123
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:05,799
Thank you.

124
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:09,759
Tell me,

125
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,960
are you Silent Protectors

126
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,279
all really good at role-playing?

127
00:11:15,679 --> 00:11:16,840
And is your line of work

128
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,440
really dangerous,

129
00:11:18,879 --> 00:11:20,159
but pays a lot of money?

130
00:11:24,559 --> 00:11:27,320
You're wearing body armor under that, right?

131
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:29,679
You can even tell that?

132
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,200
Latest ultra-thin model.

133
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,080
Don't think

134
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:36,240
wearing a vest means you can let your guard down.

135
00:11:36,799 --> 00:11:37,559
If someone

136
00:11:37,559 --> 00:11:38,159
armed with a gun

137
00:11:38,159 --> 00:11:39,960
bursts through the front door firing,

138
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:42,879
drop to the ground as fast as you can.

139
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:44,320
That's the safest thing to do.

140
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:47,360
All right, I'll leave this to you.

141
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,480
I'm going to make the rounds.

142
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:53,440
Can't I just run?

143
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:57,440
Based on the hotel guest list,

144
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,559
there's nothing suspicious.

145
00:11:58,639 --> 00:11:59,720
Everything else is normal.

146
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:06,759
Um, Rosy,

147
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,919
in the surveillance footage from the past few days,

148
00:12:08,919 --> 00:12:10,840
I haven't spotted anyone suspicious.

149
00:13:17,519 --> 00:13:18,200
Let's go.

150
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:18,840
Okay.

151
00:13:24,919 --> 00:13:25,879
This way, please.

152
00:13:42,559 --> 00:13:44,759
Hello, I have a reservation.

153
00:13:52,639 --> 00:13:53,919
Here you go. Please take this.

154
00:13:53,919 --> 00:13:54,639
Thank you.

155
00:13:55,639 --> 00:13:56,440
Let's go.

156
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,840
Is something about to happen?

157
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:11,879
Nothing.

158
00:14:13,159 --> 00:14:14,840
Then why did you send Rosy to the front desk

159
00:14:14,919 --> 00:14:16,399
and Qu Shengli to help in the kitchen?

160
00:14:18,279 --> 00:14:19,440
Just work assignments.

161
00:14:21,399 --> 00:14:23,480
You checked the hotel from top to bottom.

162
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,480
What's the real reason?

163
00:14:25,759 --> 00:14:27,360
Also part of the job.

164
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:31,919
Wei Tian.

165
00:14:33,159 --> 00:14:35,159
I don't expect you to tell me everything,

166
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:37,960
but if you have any intel,

167
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,240
I hope you'll share it with me.

168
00:14:39,519 --> 00:14:41,039
After all, if anything happens to the hotel,

169
00:14:41,279 --> 00:14:42,639
it won't just be on you.

170
00:14:43,039 --> 00:14:44,960
And you Silent Protectors aren't omnipotent.

171
00:14:46,559 --> 00:14:47,360
I agree.

172
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:50,679
You aren't allowed to carry firearms.

173
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:52,759
If a crisis occurs,

174
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,120
be prepared.

175
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:58,840
You're in charge of hotel security.

176
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:01,720
Keep yourself and your team safe.

177
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,080
Be careful.

178
00:15:04,799 --> 00:15:05,600
I will.

179
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:08,240
Can you tell me,

180
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:10,360
what's the real purpose of this meeting?

181
00:15:11,639 --> 00:15:12,440
I don't know.

182
00:15:34,879 --> 00:15:37,279
It's late, so I won't keep you.

183
00:15:37,879 --> 00:15:39,559
Get some rest.

184
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,840
Your grandfather is looking for you.

185
00:16:16,039 --> 00:16:16,840
Come on.

186
00:16:17,799 --> 00:16:18,759
Come, follow me.

187
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:32,279
How can your hotel let this happen?

188
00:16:32,279 --> 00:16:32,679
I'm so sorry, sir.

189
00:16:32,679 --> 00:16:35,360
My grandson... I can't find my grandson!

190
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:38,799
Assassin to Knight. Assassin to Knight.

191
00:16:39,799 --> 00:16:42,879
Wei Tian, the boy's grandfather is in the lobby.

192
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,000
Copy that.

193
00:16:53,759 --> 00:16:54,559
Grandpa!

194
00:16:57,360 --> 00:16:58,519
I'm terribly sorry.

195
00:16:59,399 --> 00:17:01,799
Why glare at me? I didn't lose his kid.

196
00:17:02,799 --> 00:17:04,880
Where did you find him? On the top floor?

197
00:17:06,119 --> 00:17:07,160
I knew it.

198
00:17:07,559 --> 00:17:08,680
I just sent someone up there.

199
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:09,680
How could they have missed him?

200
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:12,319
How long is their meeting running over?

201
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,599
They have no respect for the rules.

202
00:17:15,599 --> 00:17:16,519
I'll go get an explanation.

203
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:17,400
Anda.

204
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:19,359
Handle it calmly.

205
00:17:19,759 --> 00:17:22,359
Miss An, what can we do for you?

206
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,799
We've received a complaint.

207
00:17:25,799 --> 00:17:26,720
Your bodyguards

208
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:28,319
terrified another guest of ours.

209
00:17:29,039 --> 00:17:30,920
He's just a child.

210
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:32,319
I hope you understand

211
00:17:32,319 --> 00:17:33,720
how our hotel operates.

212
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:35,279
You aren't the only ones staying here,

213
00:17:35,279 --> 00:17:36,480
there are other guests.

214
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:39,680
We apologize for that.

215
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:43,119
What would you like us to do, Miss An?

216
00:17:44,599 --> 00:17:46,799
Pull all bodyguards out of the stairwells.

217
00:17:47,079 --> 00:17:49,240
And don't post so many people at the door.

218
00:17:49,599 --> 00:17:51,319
Can't you do what other bosses do

219
00:17:51,319 --> 00:17:52,480
and keep guard inside?

220
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:55,039
Our boss doesn't like being disturbed.

221
00:17:57,039 --> 00:17:58,960
He's just a little boy!

222
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:01,480
He wandered into the stairwell by accident,

223
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:04,039
and your men pulled a gun on him!

224
00:18:05,359 --> 00:18:07,119
Does every guest walking by

225
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,720
get a gun pointed at their head?

226
00:18:10,039 --> 00:18:10,839
Understood.

227
00:18:11,119 --> 00:18:12,160
We'll keep that in mind.

228
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:15,519
However, pulling the guards isn't an option.

229
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:17,880
Why don't you place a warning sign

230
00:18:18,279 --> 00:18:19,279
by the stairwell

231
00:18:19,839 --> 00:18:21,160
to keep people from wandering in?

232
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:24,720
After all, we've booked the entire floor.

233
00:18:26,319 --> 00:18:27,119
You...

234
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:27,920
I...

235
00:18:28,079 --> 00:18:30,160
I'm sorry. This is my responsibility.

236
00:18:31,839 --> 00:18:33,160
This has nothing to do with you.

237
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:34,200
Why are you apologizing?

238
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,839
They are my clients.

239
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:38,720
If any problem arises,

240
00:18:39,160 --> 00:18:40,200
it's on me.

241
00:18:43,799 --> 00:18:46,319
I was right to call them out on behalf of our guests.

242
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:47,480
You did nothing wrong.

243
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,720
Not at all.

244
00:18:50,319 --> 00:18:51,440
You're just too tense.

245
00:19:03,519 --> 00:19:04,319
Shen Yu! Shen Yu!

246
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:05,799
Target is moving toward the pool.

247
00:20:11,839 --> 00:20:12,640
Excuse me.

248
00:20:20,559 --> 00:20:22,079
Did you see someone wearing a hat?

249
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:23,039
No.

250
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:24,960
No. What about you?

251
00:20:25,079 --> 00:20:25,799
No.

252
00:20:25,799 --> 00:20:26,640
Me neither.

253
00:20:29,680 --> 00:20:30,519
All right, disperse.

254
00:20:31,519 --> 00:20:32,039
Disperse.

255
00:20:51,839 --> 00:20:52,440
Wait!

256
00:20:57,119 --> 00:20:57,599
Don't sit down.

257
00:21:08,079 --> 00:21:09,039
What's going on?

258
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:12,039
Look.

259
00:21:12,519 --> 00:21:13,519
That wire underneath.

260
00:21:14,279 --> 00:21:15,759
That maintenance worker earlier

261
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:16,920
must've connected it.

262
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:18,920
As soon as Wilson sits down,

263
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:20,519
he'll get electrocuted instantly.

264
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:23,359
From the moment Wilson got out of the car,

265
00:21:24,200 --> 00:21:25,400
this entire setup

266
00:21:26,079 --> 00:21:27,359
was orchestrated behind the scenes,

267
00:21:27,920 --> 00:21:28,799
waiting for a chance to assassinate him.

268
00:21:39,319 --> 00:21:39,920
The wire is here.

269
00:21:44,359 --> 00:21:45,640
At our Plato Hotel,

270
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:46,680
our management of water and power

271
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:48,039
is actually quite strict.

272
00:21:48,480 --> 00:21:50,359
We send staff to inspect them every day.

273
00:21:50,359 --> 00:21:52,759
So what happened at the pool

274
00:21:52,759 --> 00:21:53,880
was an accident.

275
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:55,000
It was sabotaged.

276
00:21:55,079 --> 00:21:56,319
So we won't take the blame.

277
00:21:57,240 --> 00:21:58,920
This won't be on your hotel.

278
00:21:58,920 --> 00:21:59,640
Understood.

279
00:22:01,759 --> 00:22:04,400
Ever since the chamber of commerce folks came,

280
00:22:04,880 --> 00:22:06,720
things at the hotel have gotten very tense.

281
00:22:06,759 --> 00:22:09,599
Everyone's afraid of bloodshed.

282
00:22:09,599 --> 00:22:10,559
You know how it is.

283
00:22:11,799 --> 00:22:14,200
More people inevitably brings some chaos.

284
00:22:15,359 --> 00:22:16,759
I just want to know

285
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:18,480
if there's any way,

286
00:22:18,480 --> 00:22:19,839
or anything we can do,

287
00:22:20,240 --> 00:22:22,640
so we can prevent these accidents.

288
00:22:22,759 --> 00:22:23,559
I think

289
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:25,799
you should ask Xiang for help.

290
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:28,359
Because Zhong'an has more people

291
00:22:28,880 --> 00:22:29,680
and enough strength.

292
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:32,519
All right.

293
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:34,079
Yes, sir.

294
00:22:34,799 --> 00:22:35,759
How many in your party?

295
00:22:35,799 --> 00:22:37,440
No problem. At seven o'clock, right?

296
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:39,480
Sis, could you please stop drinking?

297
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:40,200
What?

298
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:42,599
All hell's about to break loose in this hotel,

299
00:22:42,599 --> 00:22:43,960
and you're still drinking here?

300
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,839
Can't you figure out a way

301
00:22:46,839 --> 00:22:48,039
to get those people out of here?

302
00:22:50,039 --> 00:22:50,839
Look, bro,

303
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:53,240
what am I supposed to do about that?

304
00:22:53,559 --> 00:22:54,440
Besides,

305
00:22:54,559 --> 00:22:56,039
for an important case like this,

306
00:22:56,359 --> 00:22:57,759
hasn't the company always put

307
00:22:57,759 --> 00:22:58,839
Boss Xiao in charge?

308
00:22:59,440 --> 00:23:00,880
I don't have his skills.

309
00:23:00,880 --> 00:23:02,359
Big or small, all the troubles

310
00:23:02,359 --> 00:23:03,559
got dumped on Anda at once.

311
00:23:03,559 --> 00:23:05,200
I can't be like you,

312
00:23:05,200 --> 00:23:06,440
sighing and groaning all day,

313
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:07,720
acting like it's the end of the world.

314
00:23:08,079 --> 00:23:08,920
Let me tell you,

315
00:23:09,160 --> 00:23:11,680
I just care about eating and drinking well,

316
00:23:12,039 --> 00:23:13,119
keeping myself in good shape.

317
00:23:13,640 --> 00:23:15,279
When real danger strikes,

318
00:23:15,279 --> 00:23:16,599
I'll have the strength to run.

319
00:23:21,279 --> 00:23:22,079
Come on over!

320
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:22,960
Hello.

321
00:23:22,960 --> 00:23:23,880
Have you eaten yet?

322
00:23:24,079 --> 00:23:24,880
Just finished.

323
00:23:25,559 --> 00:23:26,359
Sit with us for a bit.

324
00:23:26,839 --> 00:23:28,000
No thanks, I've got work to do.

325
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:31,640
By the way, the guests you're protecting,

326
00:23:32,079 --> 00:23:32,960
when are they leaving?

327
00:23:34,279 --> 00:23:36,640
Don't go asking questions like that.

328
00:23:41,599 --> 00:23:43,119
Okay, I'll be right there.

329
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,240
Excuse me.

330
00:23:51,519 --> 00:23:52,519
This time, the assassin

331
00:23:53,359 --> 00:23:56,039
wants to make the client's death look accidental.

332
00:23:56,559 --> 00:23:59,319
So we must monitor food, water, and power,

333
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:00,960
and conduct a full sweep.

334
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:04,039
Even the chamber couldn't find anything.

335
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:05,759
Are we supposed to investigate?

336
00:24:06,519 --> 00:24:07,640
I asked a few people,

337
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:09,839
and about Wilson's accident,

338
00:24:09,880 --> 00:24:10,839
not one of them would say a word.

339
00:24:12,039 --> 00:24:13,519
It seems that this time,

340
00:24:13,519 --> 00:24:15,519
he crossed a very powerful organization.

341
00:24:16,720 --> 00:24:18,279
What puzzles me is,

342
00:24:19,440 --> 00:24:22,359
why isn't Wilson fighting back with full force?

343
00:24:22,359 --> 00:24:23,440
Why insist on staying at a hotel,

344
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:24,799
waiting for assassins to come for him?

345
00:24:25,000 --> 00:24:26,599
They must have their own plan.

346
00:24:26,599 --> 00:24:29,759
No. If this is an internal conflict,

347
00:24:30,319 --> 00:24:31,440
it's a purge of traitors.

348
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:33,519
It's not our place to get involved.

349
00:24:34,440 --> 00:24:37,039
Yet they have us protecting Wilson

350
00:24:37,279 --> 00:24:38,599
without telling us why.

351
00:24:38,599 --> 00:24:40,119
That makes me very uneasy.

352
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:43,599
I checked the chamber's recent partner companies.

353
00:24:44,119 --> 00:24:45,640
Nothing out of the ordinary.

354
00:24:50,519 --> 00:24:50,960
Right.

355
00:24:51,759 --> 00:24:53,039
Then there's this Sass.

356
00:24:53,640 --> 00:24:54,960
Whenever that guy talks,

357
00:24:54,960 --> 00:24:57,079
he only tells half the story.

358
00:24:57,240 --> 00:24:59,039
He never lays anything out straight.

359
00:24:59,119 --> 00:25:00,240
Looks like this guy

360
00:25:01,039 --> 00:25:03,160
is hiding a lot of dark schemes.

361
00:25:22,079 --> 00:25:23,759
You gathered everyone at the Plato Hotel

362
00:25:23,759 --> 00:25:24,319
for a meeting

363
00:25:24,319 --> 00:25:26,440
just to restrict our movements?

364
00:25:26,720 --> 00:25:29,240
To find out who tried to assassinate Wilson?

365
00:25:29,240 --> 00:25:30,799
And let me tell you,

366
00:25:30,799 --> 00:25:32,680
that shipment at the dock has nothing to do with me.

367
00:25:32,839 --> 00:25:34,880
I have no interest in that kind of stuff.

368
00:25:35,559 --> 00:25:36,359
Understood.

369
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:43,480
Jaswant is ruled out.

370
00:25:45,680 --> 00:25:46,480
Copy.

371
00:25:51,759 --> 00:25:52,319
What are you doing?

372
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:09,200
Routine check.

373
00:26:09,440 --> 00:26:11,200
Haven't you noticed your phones

374
00:26:11,559 --> 00:26:13,440
are being tapped?

375
00:26:13,720 --> 00:26:15,160
How can you be so sure?

376
00:26:17,319 --> 00:26:19,799
I found this in the restaurant. Look.

377
00:26:44,119 --> 00:26:44,480
Let's go.

378
00:26:46,599 --> 00:26:48,119
That damn old bastard

379
00:26:48,119 --> 00:26:49,920
actually sent someone to bug me.

380
00:27:40,759 --> 00:27:42,599
Why don't you pour yourself a drink too?

381
00:27:58,799 --> 00:27:59,759
You know me.

382
00:28:01,039 --> 00:28:02,039
Age unknown.

383
00:28:02,960 --> 00:28:04,480
After losing your memory in an attack,

384
00:28:04,480 --> 00:28:05,960
you used the first letter you saw

385
00:28:05,960 --> 00:28:07,440
to name yourself Rosy.

386
00:28:08,119 --> 00:28:09,559
Although you lost your memory,

387
00:28:09,799 --> 00:28:11,960
you never lost your intellect or knowledge.

388
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:13,319
A true genius,

389
00:28:13,359 --> 00:28:15,119
with an incredible capacity to learn.

390
00:28:18,799 --> 00:28:19,839
What a pity.

391
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:21,000
I thought

392
00:28:21,119 --> 00:28:22,799
you'd found my old memories.

393
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:27,039
I'm only attending for my brother.

394
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:30,559
I have zero attachment to this chamber.

395
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:31,920
You don't need to mind me.

396
00:28:34,839 --> 00:28:36,720
I heard you're fluent in multiple languages

397
00:28:38,720 --> 00:28:40,079
and a master negotiator.

398
00:28:40,880 --> 00:28:43,559
Ever consider switching careers to join me?

399
00:28:45,799 --> 00:28:48,440
You seem to view Wilson's incident

400
00:28:48,799 --> 00:28:50,720
with neither surprise nor guilt,

401
00:28:50,720 --> 00:28:53,240
but that doesn't mean you weren't involved.

402
00:28:55,200 --> 00:28:56,240
In fact, I think

403
00:28:56,519 --> 00:28:58,599
you're the one looking to profit the most.

404
00:29:11,400 --> 00:29:13,400
Gandana and Arles complained to me

405
00:29:14,799 --> 00:29:16,240
that they ran into a little trouble.

406
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:20,200
I know.

407
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:24,279
Just try your best to cooperate, all right?

408
00:29:26,279 --> 00:29:27,079
Wilson

409
00:29:28,079 --> 00:29:29,839
just wants to settle these matters peacefully.

410
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:33,440
He's actually someone who values old ties.

411
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:37,039
But the others...

412
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:38,720
do they care about old ties?

413
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:42,039
Your organization

414
00:29:42,799 --> 00:29:45,079
is really just a heap of loose sand.

415
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:49,480
What house is built without sand?

416
00:29:50,680 --> 00:29:52,279
You've got to believe in the power of sand.

417
00:29:53,279 --> 00:29:54,559
As long as Wilson is here,

418
00:29:55,519 --> 00:29:57,000
the local chamber of commerce will stand.

419
00:30:06,079 --> 00:30:08,799
Now I'm giving you two choices.

420
00:30:08,799 --> 00:30:10,240
First, get that shipment back.

421
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:14,400
Second, kill Wilson.

422
00:30:17,200 --> 00:30:18,319
Think it over.

423
00:30:30,839 --> 00:30:33,599
All you had to do was stage an accident for an old man,

424
00:30:33,759 --> 00:30:35,400
yet after all this time, you still haven't pulled it off.

425
00:30:35,839 --> 00:30:37,279
What the hell have you been doing?

426
00:30:37,640 --> 00:30:39,039
The man by his side...

427
00:30:39,240 --> 00:30:41,200
He's an absolute pain.

428
00:30:41,839 --> 00:30:43,839
Isn't killing people your job?

429
00:30:44,759 --> 00:30:46,279
If you're not up to the task,

430
00:30:46,359 --> 00:30:47,640
I can find someone else.

431
00:30:48,240 --> 00:30:49,279
Within three days,

432
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:51,680
if I haven't completed the job,

433
00:30:51,880 --> 00:30:54,039
I'll give you a full refund.

434
00:30:58,880 --> 00:31:01,200
Sass arranged this meeting at the Plato

435
00:31:01,920 --> 00:31:03,519
just to force him to show himself.

436
00:31:05,000 --> 00:31:05,799
In fact,

437
00:31:06,279 --> 00:31:07,799
if he's willing to admit his mistake

438
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:10,319
and clear up the matter with the shipment,

439
00:31:10,960 --> 00:31:12,799
Wilson won't make things hard for him.

440
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:16,039
If both sides can reach an agreement,

441
00:31:16,799 --> 00:31:18,599
this feud will be over.

442
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:21,799
Wilson is old.

443
00:31:22,440 --> 00:31:24,079
He doesn't have the drive he used to.

444
00:31:25,279 --> 00:31:26,720
But Sass is still around.

445
00:31:27,519 --> 00:31:29,599
As long as Sass stays by his side,

446
00:31:30,559 --> 00:31:33,480
Wilson's position won't be shaken.

447
00:31:35,559 --> 00:31:36,720
I got word

448
00:31:37,079 --> 00:31:39,359
that someone hired a hitman to assassinate Wilson.

449
00:31:41,200 --> 00:31:42,920
But Sass also hired someone even better

450
00:31:42,920 --> 00:31:44,279
to protect Wilson.

451
00:31:45,279 --> 00:31:46,519
I'd like to see

452
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:48,720
who comes out on top.

453
00:31:54,319 --> 00:31:57,160
I suggest you pull out of the chamber of commerce.

454
00:32:02,799 --> 00:32:06,039
I'm offering triple the price. Take it.

455
00:32:06,720 --> 00:32:09,200
Otherwise, you'll be their enemy.

456
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:17,319
Once we Silent Protectors sign a contract,

457
00:32:18,160 --> 00:32:20,599
we don't change it, and we don't back out.

458
00:32:21,960 --> 00:32:23,039
If you're this stubborn,

459
00:32:23,240 --> 00:32:25,000
the Silent Protectors will be hunted down.

460
00:32:30,599 --> 00:32:31,400
Fine.

461
00:32:32,599 --> 00:32:35,160
Since money can't tempt you...

462
00:32:37,079 --> 00:32:38,079
I happen to have

463
00:32:38,839 --> 00:32:40,319
intel on Hades.

464
00:32:43,079 --> 00:32:44,279
That's what you've always wanted.

465
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:07,640
Why?

466
00:33:09,759 --> 00:33:10,920
I have my principles.

467
00:33:11,559 --> 00:33:13,920
We're friends, let's drop it.

468
00:33:21,440 --> 00:33:22,000
Wei Tian.

469
00:33:24,319 --> 00:33:25,720
What's your relationship with Grace?

470
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:27,119
What did you two talk about?

471
00:33:28,440 --> 00:33:29,839
Just a normal relationship between a man and a woman.

472
00:33:31,039 --> 00:33:32,160
Where's your mind wandering?

473
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:34,920
Did the two of you exchange intel?

474
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:39,000
You sure are curious.

475
00:33:40,119 --> 00:33:40,920
I'm telling you,

476
00:33:41,200 --> 00:33:42,279
don't mess around with me.

477
00:33:43,319 --> 00:33:44,319
If someone really intends

478
00:33:44,319 --> 00:33:45,559
to assassinate Wilson,

479
00:33:45,640 --> 00:33:46,920
it will severely damage

480
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:48,279
the Plato Hotel's reputation.

481
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:50,039
Besides, most of the guests

482
00:33:50,039 --> 00:33:51,279
staying here are Chinese.

483
00:33:51,640 --> 00:33:52,559
If anyone gets hurt,

484
00:33:52,559 --> 00:33:54,039
it'll become an international incident.

485
00:33:54,680 --> 00:33:55,839
If you have any intel,

486
00:33:55,839 --> 00:33:56,799
you'd better share it with me.

487
00:34:02,319 --> 00:34:03,880
What's the deal with that flash drive?

488
00:34:05,279 --> 00:34:06,799
I'll share a copy with you next time.

489
00:34:32,800 --> 00:34:34,880
You already knew those things

490
00:34:35,079 --> 00:34:36,599
wouldn't sway that man.

491
00:34:38,119 --> 00:34:40,719
After all these years, maybe he's changed.

492
00:34:42,079 --> 00:34:43,480
I'm just the messenger.

493
00:34:43,639 --> 00:34:45,679
I don't want to make enemies with you or him.

494
00:34:45,719 --> 00:34:47,199
You did well. That's enough.

495
00:34:55,679 --> 00:34:57,360
Here, take this back.

496
00:34:58,960 --> 00:35:00,599
No need. Toss it for me.

497
00:35:18,239 --> 00:35:20,199
You've been searching for three hours.

498
00:35:20,199 --> 00:35:21,199
Is something wrong?

499
00:35:22,239 --> 00:35:24,039
I suspect an assassin slipped in here.

500
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:27,000
Wei Tian's been acting secretive lately.

501
00:35:27,239 --> 00:35:28,480
He must be looking for someone.

502
00:35:29,360 --> 00:35:32,320
So you're saying there might be...

503
00:35:32,480 --> 00:35:34,039
...an assassination attempt?

504
00:35:34,119 --> 00:35:35,840
Right. Before the meeting even started,

505
00:35:35,840 --> 00:35:37,320
Wilson was in a car crash.

506
00:35:37,679 --> 00:35:39,320
Then yesterday, there was that electrical incident.

507
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:41,920
I suspect someone is trying to kill him.

508
00:35:42,320 --> 00:35:44,599
And that person is probably still in here.

509
00:35:57,599 --> 00:36:00,000
Alright, got it. I'll be right there.

510
00:36:14,519 --> 00:36:16,159
These guys are all Wilson's men.

511
00:36:16,760 --> 00:36:17,760
Those shipping containers

512
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:19,239
held supplies for the Arles Company.

513
00:36:19,880 --> 00:36:21,079
But over a month ago,

514
00:36:21,239 --> 00:36:22,639
Wilson seized them,

515
00:36:22,800 --> 00:36:23,960
and never returned them.

516
00:36:26,880 --> 00:36:28,360
Looks like between Arles and Wilson,

517
00:36:28,360 --> 00:36:29,239
there's some bad blood.

518
00:36:30,239 --> 00:36:31,039
Yeah.

519
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:33,239
Even without an open confrontation,

520
00:36:34,280 --> 00:36:35,400
they must be

521
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:36,400
in a state of high tension.

522
00:36:38,239 --> 00:36:40,000
What on earth is inside those containers

523
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:42,360
to make Wilson so nervous?

524
00:36:43,039 --> 00:36:44,159
That, I'm not really sure about.

525
00:37:09,599 --> 00:37:11,719
Act immediately. What you need is here.

526
00:38:53,800 --> 00:38:54,920
Shalan. Shalan.

527
00:38:58,079 --> 00:38:58,519
Captain.

528
00:38:59,639 --> 00:39:00,079
Captain.

529
00:40:17,840 --> 00:40:18,440
Watch out.

530
00:40:58,880 --> 00:40:59,639
Don't worry.

531
00:41:01,599 --> 00:41:03,280
The patient is out of immediate danger.

532
00:41:14,880 --> 00:41:16,960
What? He's still alive?

533
00:41:19,480 --> 00:41:20,559
Go tell them,

534
00:41:20,920 --> 00:41:22,360
if they fail this time,

535
00:41:22,440 --> 00:41:23,519
they'll be the ones to die.

536
00:41:23,519 --> 00:41:24,239
Yes, sir.

537
00:41:48,320 --> 00:41:49,119
Got it.

538
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:50,800
I'll finish the mission.

539
00:41:51,639 --> 00:41:54,079
Fail to keep your end, and you're dead.

540
00:41:55,079 --> 00:41:57,320
I can refund all the money.

541
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:58,639
But I don't take threats.

542
00:41:59,639 --> 00:42:02,559
Anda, what did you tell the police?

543
00:42:03,039 --> 00:42:03,960
Sass told me...

544
00:42:03,960 --> 00:42:06,000
On the day of the blast, they were having hot pot.

545
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:08,960
Wilson was also injured and taken to the hospital.

546
00:42:10,719 --> 00:42:12,119
Hot pot? Really?

547
00:42:12,360 --> 00:42:13,440
With all those bullet holes in the wall,

548
00:42:13,440 --> 00:42:14,360
would the police buy that?

549
00:42:14,840 --> 00:42:15,519
They bought it.

550
00:42:16,599 --> 00:42:18,119
The opponent we're facing this time

551
00:42:18,119 --> 00:42:19,079
is really tough.

552
00:42:20,199 --> 00:42:22,079
The old man is a professional assassin

553
00:42:22,360 --> 00:42:23,719
from a remote tribe.

554
00:42:24,519 --> 00:42:26,079
He's skilled with firearms

555
00:42:26,320 --> 00:42:27,559
and ambushing in disguise.

556
00:42:28,159 --> 00:42:29,239
He's fast on his feet,

557
00:42:29,440 --> 00:42:31,599
and extremely deceptive.

558
00:42:32,679 --> 00:42:34,519
The old man strikes fast and brutally.

559
00:42:34,719 --> 00:42:36,119
Wei Tian, you have to be careful.

560
00:42:36,119 --> 00:42:38,039
Even I fell into their trap.

561
00:42:38,199 --> 00:42:39,360
It's really embarrassing.

562
00:42:40,719 --> 00:42:42,880
I misjudged their method of attack.

563
00:42:44,159 --> 00:42:45,119
I always assumed

564
00:42:45,719 --> 00:42:48,440
they staged accidents to carry out hits.

565
00:42:49,800 --> 00:42:52,039
Maybe the employer behind them

566
00:42:52,679 --> 00:42:53,840
couldn't wait any longer.

567
00:42:55,880 --> 00:42:57,199
This is Wilson's personal feud

568
00:42:57,199 --> 00:42:58,920
with the chamber of commerce.

569
00:43:01,880 --> 00:43:03,280
It's not our place to get involved.

570
00:43:07,119 --> 00:43:08,400
If anyone has objections,

571
00:43:08,960 --> 00:43:10,079
as usual,

572
00:43:10,440 --> 00:43:11,400
we put it to a vote.

573
00:43:12,760 --> 00:43:13,800
I say we continue.

574
00:43:17,239 --> 00:43:19,199
I don't like Sass using us,

575
00:43:19,599 --> 00:43:21,440
but what I tolerate even less

576
00:43:21,440 --> 00:43:23,400
is being played by that old man and his grandson.

577
00:43:26,360 --> 00:43:27,920
I'm feeling a bit dizzy.

578
00:43:29,159 --> 00:43:30,800
I don't really want to go on missions lately.

579
00:43:30,960 --> 00:43:31,840
If you all agree

580
00:43:31,840 --> 00:43:33,480
to let me rest at home,

581
00:43:34,880 --> 00:43:35,800
I might consider it.
